// The scaffold: this machine's kernel and boot loader with a stock Arch
// userspace (image/mkscaffold.sh prepares the tree), so the deployment
// mechanics can be tested without building joe. Nothing from it ships.
// image/mkscaffold-dave.sh builds it with dave added (--tree) and packages
// installed on top (--with).
.{
    .name = "scaffold",
    .tree = "../build/scaffold/rootfs",
    .cmdline = "console=ttyS0,115200",
}
